cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "State of ATS 2026: employer-to-applicant-tracking-system attribution"
abstract: >-
  A selected sample of 738 employers with recorded ATS attributions and mixed
  automated and manual careers-portal evidence. 704 rows are marked verified;
  551 publish an apply host. A verification flag alone can rest on the original
  June 2026 audit without a published host artifact. Evidence dates are per row;
  a package release is not revalidation. Counts describe this selected sample,
  and observed hosts do not establish private screening configurations.
type: dataset
